🇺🇸🇮🇷 US Attacks On Iran Continue

▪️For weeks the US has been conducting shaping operations and gathering ISR ahead of what will almost certainly be another round of open, full-scale aggression;

▪️The US has been reorganizing basing in and near the region, the posture of its fleet, and performing a logistics build-up for weeks as well;

▪️The "date" for the US attack is when the US is ready - a date both US actions and Iranian reaction has influence over either speeding up or pushing back;

▪️This all takes place within a wider decades-spanning campaign of encroachment and containment the US has applied to Iran, attempting to undermine Iran's economy, stability and military readiness;

▪️Again, just with the attack date, US actions and Iranian reactions adjusts the degree to which this campaign succeeds or fails - and is also dependent on the US' ability to press other nations into service and Iran's allies' ability to counter the additional weight that adds;

▪️And of course, US aggression toward Iran is just one part of a wider war on the multipolar world including Russia and  China - aggression on Iran effects both nations, and US actions toward both nations effects their ability to aid Iran;

▪️Separating Iran from or ignoring altogether this wider global conflict undermines understanding either clearly;
